      "id": "draft.pilot6.site.01",
      "stem": "A billing service must pass transaction validation and user cutover within four hours of losing its primary site. Its hard monthly recovery-site budget is $10,000. Three fixed packages are available: a $2,000 cold site has power and space but needs eight hours to install compute and networking, then two hours to load production software and data, then one hour for validation and cutover; an $8,000 warm site already has compatible compute and networking, but needs two hours to load production software and data, then one hour for validation and cutover; a $20,000 hot site has production software and a current data copy ready, with tested end-to-end cutover in 20 minutes. The tested sequential timings include staffing and every required dependency. All packages meet the separate one-hour data-loss limit and the required capacity, security and geographic separation. Prices cannot be reduced; no other recovery path is available. Which plan meets both the deadline and budget?",
      "options": [
        "Choose the cold site and complete its full installation, loading, validation and cutover sequence.",
        "Choose the warm site and complete production software/data loading, then validation and cutover.",
        "Choose the hot site because its prepared service provides the fastest tested cutover.",
        "Choose the warm site and skip software/data loading because compatible hardware is already installed."
      ],
      "correctOption": 1,
      "optionFeedback": [
        "The cold site fits the budget but takes 8 + 2 + 1 = 11 hours before usable service. Available space and power do not remove the compute/network installation work; eleven hours misses the four-hour deadline.",
        "Correct: the warm site costs $8,000, within the $10,000 cap, and its complete 2 + 1 = 3-hour sequence meets the four-hour deadline. Installed hardware is not yet a usable production service; software/data loading and validation still matter.",
        "The hot site meets the time requirement, but its fixed $20,000 monthly price exceeds the hard $10,000 budget. Faster recovery does not make an unavailable budget exception part of the allowed plan.",
        "Compatible hardware does not contain the required production software and data in this warm-site package. Skipping that required loading cannot produce the stipulated validated billing service, even if it appears to save time."
      ],
      "format": "mcq",
      "cognitiveSkill": "scenario_application",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "difficultyStatus": "proposed_uncalibrated",
